=== Other ===
* Range Up [[pill]]s increase Range by {{dlc|nr}} 2.5 {{dlc|r}} 1.25, and Range Down pills decrease Range by {{dlc|nr}} 2 {{dlc|r}} 1.
* {{dlc|a}} In co-op, [[Co-op#Special Babies 2|Long Baby]] will occasionally briefly increase Range, Shot Speed, and Tear Falling Speed. [[Co-op#Special Babies 2|Dark Baby]] will occasionally briefly increase all stats, including Range. [[Co-op#Special Babies 2|Dripping Baby]] will occasionally briefly grant {{I|Anemic}}, increasing Range.
* {{P|XI - Strength}} activates the {{I|Magic Mushroom}} effect for the current room, which increases Range.
* {{dlc|a+}} Absorbing an item using {{p|Black Rune|n}} can increase Range by 2.5.
* {{P|Huge Growth|a+}} and {{dlc|r}} [[Pills#Horse Pills|horse]] [[Power Pill!]] increases Range, Damage, and Isaac's size for the current room.

